# INVWINPT.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PANEA.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the items of
# TEST/KEYS/PANEA.REQ, items 3 and 4 installed in item 1, item 6 in
# item 5 and item 8 in item 7: the parts beside the assemblies.  Items >
# Assemblies shows items 1, 5 and 7 and beside them item 1's parts;
# DOWN, and the parts are item 5's; Record > Service records shows item
# 5's, none, and ESC the assemblies again, item 5 selected with its part
# beside it.  Move on item 1 moves it to B2, and
# its parts, fetched again, show that location.  F6 gives the parts the
# focus, the count theirs; INS there installs item 2 in item 1, the
# assembly beside them; item 4, the third of them, shown in its form,
# opens its service records by Service, and ESC shows the parts again
# with the focus, item 4 selected under its form; Take out with two of
# them chosen takes both
# out, and ENTER shows the part left in its form.  ESC gives the
# assemblies the focus.  View > Pane beside the list shows them alone,
# item 1 still selected, and again with the parts; the splitter dragged
# left narrows them.  READER sees the parts, where INS is refused.
# ADMIN again takes item 5's one part out from the parts: item 5 leaves
# the assemblies, which, fetched again, keep the row it had, item 7's
# now, and take the focus, the parts following to item 7's.  Item 7's
# part taken out likewise leaves item 1 selected, and the last of its
# parts no assembly: the parts empty and disabled, the assemblies with
# the focus, and Locations > Location types' list, closed, leaves them
# so.  The end by Exit: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/PANEA.CFG is the settings file
# it leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPT.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I A
S ASSY
K DOWN
S FOLLOW
# the assembly left kept by ESC on its service records
K ALT-C S
S ASSYSVC
K ESC
S ASSYBACK
K UP ALT-C M
T B2
K ENTER
S MOVED
K F6
S PARTS
K INS
T 2
K ENTER
S INSTALL
# the part left kept by ESC on its service records, its form over it
K DOWN DOWN ENTER
M 149 DOWN MID
M 149 UP MID
S PARTSVC
K ESC
S PARTBACK
K ESC HOME
K SHIFT-DOWN ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S OUT2
K ENTER
S PARTFORM
K ESC ESC
S MASTER
K ALT-V P
S ALONE
K ALT-V P
S BOTH
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID -60 0
M 220 UP MID -60 0
S DRAGGED
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-I A F6
S READER
K INS
S REFUSED
K ENTER ALT-F L STAB
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I A DOWN F6 ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S LAST
K F6 ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S LAST2
K F6 ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S EMPTY
K ALT-L T ESC
S TYPES
K ALT-F X
